      "value": "@{6051ba310127dc2014bf1392|full_name}: That makes sense, if it's only 1 keyframe it can save it midway on its movement to the rest position so it can look stretched, giving it extra keyframes might fix it, but still its a bug that vrc has to fix and they haven't, its like if this doesn't get 100+ votes they wont do anything...",
