  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-25T02:54:55.393Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey, this has been an issue since 2 months ago but i had hopes it was going to get fixed, my fault for hoping too much.\nThis is the issue, i have physic bones component in, for example my tongue, it's disabled by default, with a gesture or an animaton i turn it on along a blendshape to move the tongue out, all working good until i disable the physic bones component while i'm moving, then i notice the tongue doesn't get inside the mouth fully, it seems to get stuck halfway to its default rest position.\nApparently this happens when you're moving, when disabling the component the tongue looks stretched and saves halfway. I'm sorry i can't really explain it better, but i will show some videos that i've recorded showing this issue, with the tongue and with my hair (which has a blendshape to make it shorter and keep it inside my head).\nTongue: https://streamable.com/pcoa3w\nHair: https://streamable.com/t0a980\nIt was working perfectly with dynamic bones, i can give more info if you need it just ask.",
